1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:04,963
Hello!

5
00:00:05,513 --> 00:00:08,376
Today we're visiting the farm!

6
00:00:09,726 --> 00:00:11,678
Look! It's a cow.

7
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:13,146
Cow!

8
00:00:13,696 --> 00:00:15,648
What does the cow say?

9
00:00:17,048 --> 00:00:17,834
Moo!

10
00:00:18,384 --> 00:00:20,503
The cow gives us milk.

11
00:00:21,854 --> 00:00:23,568
Who is this?

12
00:00:25,368 --> 00:00:26,981
It's a sheep!

13
00:00:27,531 --> 00:00:29,435
What does the sheep say?

14
00:00:30,835 --> 00:00:31,964
Baa, baa!

15
00:00:32,514 --> 00:00:35,229
The sheep has soft, fluffy wool.

16
00:00:36,579 --> 00:00:38,602
Look! It's a pig.

17
00:00:39,102 --> 00:00:40,110
Pig!

18
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,589
What does the pig say?

19
00:00:43,989 --> 00:00:45,118
Oink, oink!

20
00:00:45,668 --> 00:00:48,382
The pig loves to roll in the mud.

21
00:00:49,732 --> 00:00:51,685
Look! It's a horse.

22
00:00:52,185 --> 00:00:53,273
Horse!

23
00:00:53,823 --> 00:00:55,752
What does the horse say?

24
00:00:57,152 --> 00:00:57,918
Neigh!

25
00:00:58,468 --> 00:01:00,920
The horse can run very fast.

26
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:03,985
Who is this?

27
00:01:05,785 --> 00:01:07,297
It's a duck!

28
00:01:07,847 --> 00:01:09,728
What does the duck say?

29
00:01:11,128 --> 00:01:12,216
Quack, quack!

30
00:01:12,766 --> 00:01:15,123
The duck swims in the pond.

31
00:01:16,473 --> 00:01:18,426
Look! It's a hen.

32
00:01:18,926 --> 00:01:20,035
Hen!

33
00:01:20,585 --> 00:01:22,537
What does the hen say?

34
00:01:23,937 --> 00:01:25,147
Cluck, cluck!

35
00:01:25,697 --> 00:01:27,721
The hen lays eggs.

36
00:01:29,070 --> 00:01:31,142
Look! It's a little chick.

37
00:01:31,642 --> 00:01:32,509
Chick!

38
00:01:33,059 --> 00:01:35,011
What does the chick say?

39
00:01:36,411 --> 00:01:37,520
Cheep, cheep!

40
00:01:38,870 --> 00:01:40,584
Who is this?

41
00:01:42,384 --> 00:01:44,037
It's a dog!

42
00:01:44,587 --> 00:01:46,540
What does the dog say?

43
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,109
Woof, woof!

44
00:01:49,659 --> 00:01:52,088
The dog helps on the farm.

45
00:01:53,438 --> 00:01:56,200
We met all the farm animals!

46
00:01:56,750 --> 00:01:58,988
Great job, little learner!

47
00:01:59,538 --> 00:02:01,426
Share Mimzi with a friend,

48
00:02:01,426 --> 00:02:03,966
and subscribe for more learning fun!

49
00:02:04,516 --> 00:02:05,523
Next time,

50
00:02:05,523 --> 00:02:07,924
let's meet the wild animals.

51
00:02:08,173 --> 00:02:09,544
Bye bye!
